        {
            "title": "Celsius股價飆升12%，Rockstar創辦人建立4.7%持股並要求撤換CEO",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"Celsius股價飆升12%，Rockstar創辦人建立4.7%持股並要求撤換CEO\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ad8157a41c8ce261f988e7446d1b635a5650b7aeec9c8bd0ee5752a37fbb91d7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fi-invdn-com.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA9Q076_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">Celsius股價飆升12%，Rockstar創辦人建立4.7%持股並要求撤換CEO</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com — Celsius Holdings（NASDAQ:CELH）股價週五大漲12%，收復了前一交易日的部分跌幅。據CNBC報導，Rockstar Energy創辦人Russ Savage已悄然建立該公司持股，並積極尋求撤換現任CEO。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Savage向CNBC透露，他目前持有Celsius共1,200萬股，約佔這家能量飲料公司股份的4.7%。按當前股價計算，該持股市值約為3億美元。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-561b657e-3125-3d9e-a250-ea0b5127cc57-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">這位Rockstar創辦人表示，鑑於Celsius本週財報表現遜於預期，加上他所指出的管理層一系列失誤，公司領導層必須進行更替。Savage更主動表示願意出任CEO一職。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Savage在接受CNBC採訪時直言：「CEO、COO、品牌經理和行銷經理全都應該被撤換。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Savage於2001年創立Rockstar能量飲料，並於2020年以38.5億美元將其出售給百事可樂（PepsiCo）。過去逾一年間，他一直在幕後向Celsius提供建議，涵蓋成本結構調整及行銷策略優化，但如今他表示，公司需要引入全新的領導層。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/celsius%E8%82%A1%E5%83%B9%E9%A3%86%E5%8D%8712-rockstar%E5%89%B5%E8%BE%A6%E4%BA%BA%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B4-7-%E6%8C%81%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%A6%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E6%92%A4%E6%8F%9Bceo-163429783.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-08-08 00:36:53",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "西班牙與義大利因移民問題針鋒相對 邊境管控之爭衝擊申根自由通行",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">【彭博】-- 在7萬名移民突然湧入<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/西班牙\" rel=\"\">西班牙</a>位於非洲的飛地後，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/義大利\" rel=\"\">義大利</a>實施了新的邊境管控措施，並明確拒絕取消相關限制，導致西班牙與義大利圍繞移民問題的爭端進一步升級。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">雙方周五針鋒相對，西班牙首先警告稱，如果義大利不撤銷相關措施，西班牙將採取對等的邊境檢查。數小時後，義大利作出強硬回應。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">義大利政府在一份聲明中表示，「義大利不接受最後通牒。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">不斷升級的爭端正對歐洲實行人員自由流動的申根區造成壓力，也威脅到歐洲恢復團結的努力。上個月，大批移民湧入與摩洛哥接壤的西班牙非洲飛地休達。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-ca3f1ed3-e1e0-3f3c-b8bf-602158826f50-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">事件發生後，多名歐盟領導人批評西班牙首相佩德羅·桑切斯，其中一些人甚至威脅暫停西班牙的申根區成員資格。隨後，義大利開始對從西班牙入境的非歐盟公民實施新的邊境檢查。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">原文標題Spain and Italy Step Up Border Control Fight Over Migrant Crisis</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">--聯合報導 Jorge Valero.</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">More stories like this are available on <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"bloomberg.com\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:bloomberg.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">bloomberg.com</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">©2026 Bloomberg L.P.</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%A5%BF%E7%8F%AD%E7%89%99%E8%88%87%E7%BE%A9%E5%A4%A7%E5%88%A9%E5%9B%A0%E7%A7%BB%E6%B0%91%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E9%87%9D%E9%8B%92%E7%9B%B8%E5%B0%8D-%E9%82%8A%E5%A2%83%E7%AE%A1%E6%8E%A7%E4%B9%8B%E7%88%AD%E8%A1%9D%E6%93%8A%E7%94%B3%E6%A0%B9%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E9%80%9A%E8%A1%8C-155107576.html",
