            "title": "SK海力士調整中國布局？30億美元重慶廠傳尋找投資人",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"SK海力士調整中國布局？30億美元重慶廠傳尋找投資人\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0ab72c206be2ceb7708025a09bce4913def9c069945242e787d9e290fae30e0c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F0de7ade9e311a1ddf740b1a3c774f145\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">SK海力士調整中國布局？30億美元重慶廠傳尋找投資人</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/sk%E6%B5%B7%E5%8A%9B%E5%A3%AB%E8%AA%BF%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E5%B8%83%E5%B1%80-30%E5%84%84%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%87%8D%E6%85%B6%E5%BB%A0%E5%82%B3%E5%B0%8B%E6%89%BE%E6%8A%95%E8%B3%87%E4%BA%BA-143005939.html",
